abstract: >
  A reproducible, self-contained `targets` (R) pipeline for Study 2
  (agronomic management -- fertilisation source and crop residue treatments,
  and their interaction with position relative to vertical PV panels) of a
  PhD research programme on vertical agrivoltaics at Aarhus University,
  Foulum (Value4Farm project). Bundles the raw/intermediate input data it
  reads locally under 1_input_data/, copied from the companion
  V4F_agrivoltaics repository (github.com/kamaulindhardt/V4F_agrivoltaics),
  which remains the canonical source for new data collection and also holds
  the Study 1 (microclimate/DAISY modelling) and Study 3 (whole-system)
  analyses. See README.md and docs/ for details.
